Merged the null and bounds checks into one unlikely guard so the hot path executes a single conditional branch. Also kept the member loads minimal and preserved the original short-circuit null safety.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumComponents(void) const
{
    const auto* p = profile;
    const auto idx = profileIndex;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL || idx >= p->numFields, 0))
        return 0;
    return p->fields[idx].numComponents;
}
```